// Command & Conquer: Generals Zero Hour -- Interslavic (Medžuslovjansky) game text
//
// Plain UTF-8. One entry is a label line, a quoted string, and END.
// Lines starting with // are comments. Escapes: \n \t \" \\
//
// Translated from the English original (EnglishZH.big, generals.csf) into Interslavic in the
// standard Latin orthography (ě č š ž, no etymological letters). There is no official release
// to take names from: the faction stays "GLA", named units keep their English names (Crusader,
// Scorpion, Comanche, Chinook, Helix, Raptor, Aurora), the rest are translated (Česticovo dělo,
// Burja SCUD, Podslušny post). Multiplayer map names are translated. Includes legacy labels for
// older game data. Checked with scripts/language/translate_kit.py.
// See languages/README.md before editing.

